* Nodal analysis, example 2: a supernode
* From the Solved Circuits video "Nodal Analysis with a Supernode: 3 Solved Examples (Easy to Exam Level)", https://youtu.be/7w-oSkPatcw (CC BY 4.0)
I1 0 n1 5
Ra n1 n2 2
Rb n2 0 4
Rc n3 0 6
Rd n1 n3 8
Vs n2 n3 10
.op
